   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Places",
     "texto": [
      "Many place nouns take the definite article when we talk about a specific place: **muzeu → muzeul** («museum → the museum»), **gară → gara** («train station → the train station»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Near or far",
     "texto": [
      "**Aproape** means «near» and **departe**, «far». In Romanian, **lângă** means «next to» and is followed directly by the noun, just as English does with «next to the park»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
